                                "sense_id": "b80f1076-1faf-35f6-a186-4e616ffc99e9",
                                "text": "“Skunks first colonized this land in 1794. With the arrival of European settlers, an uneasy truce was established tween man and skunk. Gifts were exchanged. Treaties were struck... and broken. A feud ignited, resulting in the Battle of Skunktown.”"
